</li>
<li class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:helvetica-w01-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Conferences</span>: Bridging the gap between global thought leaders and industry execution.</span></span></span></p>
</li>
<li class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:helvetica-w01-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Trainings</span>: Empowering workforces with specialized, next-generation skill sets.</span></span></span></p>
</li>
<li class="wixui-rich-text__text">
<p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text" style="font-size:18px;"><span style="font-weight:normal;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-family:helvetica-w01-light,sans-serif;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="color:#000000;" class="wixui-rich-text__text"><span style="font-weight:bold;" class="wixui-rich-text__text">Expos</span>: Showcasing the cutting edge of industrial technology and safety.</span></span></span></p>
